# Build-context filter for Dockerfile.mcp (BuildKit reads
# "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" in preference to the context-root .dockerignore).
#
# The build context has to be the repo ROOT so the image can COPY the `gridiron/`
# package — but the repo root is the whole NVIDIA cuOpt source tree (cpp/, CUDA,
# datasets, notebooks). Without this file every build uploads all of it to the
# daemon to use one small pure-Python package.
#
# A repo-root .dockerignore would be the usual place for this; it is deliberately
# NOT used, because this fork's house rule is that nothing outside `gridiron*` is
# touched (enforced by gridiron/verify.sh step 5).
#
# Whitelist: exclude every top-level entry, then re-include the overlay package.
*
!gridiron
